<title>USA: Meadow Valley awarded $54.8 million.</title>
<headline>Meadow Valley awarded $54.8 million.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meadow Valley Corp said it was awarded a $54.8 million contract by the Arizona Department of Transportation for the construction of a new section of the Pima Freeway in metropolitan Phoenix.</p>
<p>The freeway construction project is scheduled to begin in July. Meadow Valley also said it was awarded a $1 million contract for work on a Northern Arizona highway.</p>
<p>These new contracts increase Meadow Valley's backlog by nearly 40 percent to an all-time record of about $161 million compared to about $115 million at June 30, 1996.</p>
</text>
